            "sid": "ECC 11:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuúng masoómo, masoombi'iimarók sa qwalaala/eek, nee muunaáwók qwala/aseek baraá masoombaimaroge. Adór ta sla' baraá muunaáwoge eehareek, nee adór ilaawoge taqo ga/eera. Ala ka xú' baraá muruuwí sleémeerowo Mungú kuúng u huuw baraá sakwasleema.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.11.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.11.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
